lanation":"들어가다：包含，插入，夹进；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"5","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어간","audio":"/audio/58f73e66235f1c1ca913.mp3"}},{"text":"렌즈를","meaning":"隐形眼镜","explanation":"렌즈：隐形眼镜；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"렌즈","audio":"/audio/e302cd1329cfcc550f44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52537","senseId":"2","lemma":"렌즈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"렌즈를","audio":"/audio/6670ab3c28c80a2a5ab1.mp3"}},{"text":"낀","meaning":"戴着，佩戴","explanation":"끼다：戴着，佩戴；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"끼다","audio":"/audio/62c9da6515c8237ff0f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38439","senseId":"2","lemma":"끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낀","audio":"/audio/76bcf61a6a55e0a714ef.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"这件事、这种情况（것 + 이）","explanation":"게 是依存名词 것 和主格助词 이 的缩合，指前面修饰的事物、行为或情况，并把它作为主语；这里不是表示将来计划的 -ㄹ/을 것이다。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"아닐까?","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"아닐까","audio":"/audio/f8f42b836fe290ea5a92.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아닐까","audio":"/audio/f8f42b836fe290ea5a92.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"27555478331997f6","term":"파랗다","zh":"蓝","audio":"/audio/27555478331997f6bc6b.mp3","entryId":"71306","definition":"像晴朗的秋天的天空或深邃的大海一样明亮鲜明的颜色。","pronunciation":["파ː라타"]},{"id":"3d409d9195a62903","term":"색깔","zh":"颜色，色彩","audio":"/audio/3d409d9195a629032477.mp3","entryId":"57307","definition":"物体在光照下显出的色泽。","pronunciation":["색깔"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","te